# grant nothing. Access is decided by Firestore rules
# (firebase/firestore.rules) and by signing in.
#
# Hardening worth doing in Google Cloud console → Credentials: restrict this
# browser key to the app's own domains (gym-zveat.vercel.app, localhost) so it
# cannot be used from anywhere else.

